      "message": "Yicheng,\n\nIs it possible some other issue is occurring that fix hides?\n\nOn nocturne:\n\n---\n\n# Normal unloaded cpu\nlocalhost ~ # time  ectool --name\u003dcros_fp fpmode capture pattern0; time ectool --name\u003dcros_fp waitevent 5 5000\nFP mode: (0x20000008) capture \n\nreal\t0m0.020s\nuser\t0m0.003s\nsys\t0m0.002s\nMKBP event 5 data: 00 00 00 80 \n\nreal\t0m0.028s\nuser\t0m0.001s\nsys\t0m0.002s\n\n\n# Loaded cpu:\nlocalhost ~ # ectool --name\u003dcros_fp fpmode capture pattern0; time ectool --name\u003dcros_fp waitevent 5 5000\nFP mode: (0x20000008) capture \nTimeout waiting for MKBP event\n\nreal\t0m5.084s\nuser\t0m0.002s\nsys\t0m0.000s\nlocalhost ~ # (ectool --name\u003dcros_fp waitevent 5 500 \u0026\u0026 ectool --name\u003dcros_fp fpframe \u003e /tmp/pattern0.pnm) \u0026 ectool --name\u003dcros_fp fpmode capture pattern0\n[1] 3996\nFP mode: (0x20000008) capture \nlocalhost ~ # Timeout waiting for MKBP event\n\n[1]+  Exit 1                  ( ectool --name\u003dcros_fp waitevent 5 500 \u0026\u0026 ectool --name\u003dcros_fp fpframe \u003e /tmp/pattern0.pnm )\nlocalhost ~ # \n",
